            "pages": {
              "end": 25,
              "start": 25
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Chief Justice Roberts asked whether a dismissal pursuant to an agreement that the defendant testifies against another, in exchange for dismissal, is consistent with innocence."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "90d2b7f7a5a2f73a04dda83f9629557d7f9d668e53f4766db47e396b7cf83df7",
