            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Gorsuch asked how the elements of a malicious\u2011prosecution claim under the Fourth Amendment could be decided if the claim\u2019s existence is uncertain."
      }
