              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 68,
                "start": 68
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Respondents, the Second Circuit correctly interpreted the favorable\u2011termination requirement, requiring that the underlying criminal charges end in a manner indicative of innocence."
        }
